          "id": "b1a08e0d1d99f8cd3598859d0523c3be",
          "text": ">>> def f():\n...     raise ExceptionGroup(\n...         \"group1\",\n...         [\n...             OSError(1),\n...             SystemError(2),\n...             ExceptionGroup(\n...                 \"group2\",\n...                 [\n...                     OSError(3),\n...                     RecursionError(4)\n...                 ]\n...             )\n...         ]\n...     )\n...\n>>> try:\n...     f()\n... except* OSError as e:\n...     print(\"There were OSErrors\")\n... except* SystemError as e:\n",
